      "body": "Please don't! Let the application developer choose library, design and style of the warning he wants to use!\r\n\r\nThere are many different applications out there. So I think this should really be up to the plugin user. The user probably has to consult a lawyer on this anyway.\r\n\r\nIMO: Maybe just include a big hint to the README and a link to the EU legislation documents.\r\n\r\n(In my case if you add it I just have work with figuring out how to switch it off on one server where consent is given offline and redesign it on the other ;(",
